id: ops-changelog-dependency-updates
title: Keep published dependency bullets when releases also have tracker items
description: "Closing items for 2026.11.11 and 2026.11.15 reveals the package changelog generator's default suppression of published dependency bullets. Opt into dependency updates consistently in the generator, check, and release-note entry points in a separate change. Closure PR #294 should wait for that change."
