acceptance_criteria: Generation and its byte check retain all published dependency PR bullets in 2026.11.11 and 2026.11.15 alongside tracker entries.
resolution: Delivered
close_reason: "Delivered by pm-ops#317 (merge commit 8138cf0, merged 2026-11-24T01:18:59Z): every pm-changelog entry point (changelog, changelog:full, changelog:check, release:notes) now passes --dependency-updates. This closure PR regenerated on top of it (e810826) and keeps all 35 published dependency sections."
